<div class="block-section-header uk-section-default uk-section" uk-scrollspy="target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-small; delay: 200;">
    
        
        
        
            
                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    <div class="uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-grid-column-large uk-grid-margin" uk-grid>
<div class="uk-width-1-2@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    
<h4 uk-scrollspy-class>        Argonaut is a fully licensed Australian stockbroking firm, servicing retail, wholesale, corporate, and high-net-worth clients.    </h4>
                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="uk-width-1-2@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    <div class="uk-panel uk-margin" uk-scrollspy-class><p>Our team of experienced brokers provide access to a range of investment services supported by institutional-grade research, trading facilitation, and investment insights. Whether you’re focused on constructing a long-term, diversified portfolio or seeking to capitalise on timely market opportunities, our team can facilitate your individual investment approach.</p></div>
                
            
        
    
</div></div>
                                </div>                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="block-interactive-accordion uk-section-primary uk-section uk-section-large" uk-scrollspy="target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-small; delay: 200;">
    
        
        
        
            
                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    <div class="uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-child-width-1-1 uk-grid-margin">
<div class="uk-width-1-1">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    
<h3 class="uk-h5" uk-scrollspy-class>        What we do    </h3>
<h3 class="uk-width-xlarge@l" uk-scrollspy-class>        <p>Our focus centres on identifying opportunities in sectors where we perceive value, to help our clients make future-focused decisions in a constantly evolving market &#8211;</p>    </h3>
<div class="accordion-cta-container" uk-scrollspy="target: &gt; div; cls: uk-animation-fade; delay: 600;" uk-scrollspy-class>    <div class="accordion-cta uk-child-width-1-2@m variation" uk-grid data-mode="click">        <div>
            <div class="images">
                                    <div data-id="0" class="item">
                        <img decoding="async" style="--i: 0" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/J1P6254_cropped.jpg" alt="" />
                                                                    </div>
                                    <div data-id="1" class="item">
                        <img decoding="async" style="--i: 1" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/J1P6332.jpg" alt="" />
                                                                    </div>
                                    <div data-id="2" class="item">
                        <img decoding="async" style="--i: 2" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/J1P6678.jpg" alt="" />
                                                                    </div>
                                    <div data-id="3" class="item">
                        <img decoding="async" style="--i: 3" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/J1P6584.jpg" alt="" />
                                                                    </div>
                            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="cta">
                                <a data-id="0"  class="item">
                        <div>
<div class="el-item">                <h3 class="el-title">Capital Markets Deal Flow and Opportunities</h3>        
                <div class="el-content"><p>We provide eligible investors with access to equity capital raising opportunities and exclusive placements, allowing participation in high-potential deals within the resources sector.</p></div>        </div></div>
                    </a>
                                    <a data-id="1"  class="item">
                        <div>
<div class="el-item">                <h3 class="el-title">Access to Leading Markets</h3>        
                <div class="el-content"><p>As a Trading Participant of the ASX, NSX, and Cboe, we offer our clients direct access to the Australian securities market and international trading platforms. We also provide equity settlement, off-market processing, and portfolio administration.</p></div>        </div></div>
                    </a>
                                    <a data-id="2"  class="item">
                        <div>
<div class="el-item">                <h3 class="el-title">Research-Backed Insights</h3>        
                <div class="el-content"><p>Our extensive in-house research team is bolstered by deep industry knowledge from our analysts, including geologists and mining engineers. We conduct research that focuses on identifying market trends and provides actionable insights for well-informed trading and investment decisions.</p></div>        </div></div>
                    </a>
                                    <a data-id="3"  class="item">
                        <div>
<div class="el-item">                <h3 class="el-title">International Trading and Nominee Service</h3>        
                <div class="el-content"><p>We provide a nominee service for clients looking to access international markets. With global broker affiliations, we facilitate trading in markets including the USA, Canada, and the UK. Our team provides guidance and assistance in processing, transacting, and settling.</p></div>        </div></div>
                    </a>
                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
                
            
        
    
</div></div>
