<h3 uk-scrollspy-class>        <p>Track your portfolio and stay informed with market movements<o:p></o:p></p>    </h3><div class="uk-panel uk-margin" uk-scrollspy-class><p>As an active client, you have access to Argonaut’s Client Portal, a dedicated space designed to help you track your portfolio and stay informed on market movements with ease.</p></div><div class="login-buttons" uk-scrollspy-class><a href="https://client.argonaut.tradecentre.io/" class="uk-link-text client-portal-login-link" target="_blank">Login to Argonaut&#039;s Client Portal</a>
<a href="https://www.argonaut.com/request-access-client-portal/" class="uk-link-text research-portal-login-link" target="_blank">Request access to Argonaut&#039;s Client Portal</a></div>
                
            
        
    
